<title>USA: Unisys to offer $250 mln of senior notes.</title>
<headline>Unisys to offer $250 mln of senior notes.</headline>
<dateline>BLUE BELL, Pa. 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unisys Corp said Tuesday it plans to offer $250 million of senior notes due 2004 under a previously filed $500 million shelf registration.</p>
<p>The company said it intends to use the net proceeds from the offering to call, at par, its $135 million principal amount of 8-7/8 percent notes due July 1997 and to call or otherwise retire other securities set to mature in the near future.</p>
</text>
